        <!-- Part 3: Docker Compose 배포 -->
        <section class="mb-12">
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-orange-600 text-white rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">🎼 Part 3: Docker Compose 배포</h2>
                <p class="text-orange-100">여러 컨테이너를 한 번에 관리. 애플리케이션 + 데이터베이스 + 기타 서비스를 통합 관리</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-500 rounded-r-lg p-6 mb-8">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-yellow-900 mb-2">💡 이 실습의 목적</h3>
                <p class="text-yellow-800 mb-3">
                    현재는 AWS RDS를 사용하므로 별도 DB 컨테이너가 필요 없지만,
                    <strong>Docker Compose의 사용법을 익히기 위해</strong> 애플리케이션만 Docker Compose로 배포합니다.
                </p>
                <p class="text-yellow-800">
                    실제 프로젝트에서는 MariaDB, Redis, Nginx 등 여러 컨테이너를 함께 관리할 수 있습니다.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- 3-1: docker-compose.yml 작성 -->
            <div class="mb-8">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4 flex items-center">
                    <span class="step-number" style="background: #f97316;">1</span>
                    docker-compose.yml 작성
                </h3>

                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-3">📄 프로젝트 루트에 docker-compose.yml 생성</h4>

                    <pre class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-lg overflow-x-auto"><code class="language-yaml">version: '3.8'

services:
  app:
    build:
      context: .
      dockerfile: Dockerfile
    image: goormjpa-app:latest
    container_name: goormjpa-app
    ports:
      - "8080:8080"
    environment:
      - SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=prod
    restart: unless-stopped
    networks:
      - goormjpa-network

networks:
  goormjpa-network:
    driver: bridge</code></pre>

                    <div class="mt-4 bg-orange-50 border-l-4 border-orange-500 p-4 rounded-r">
                        <p class="text-sm text-orange-800 mb-2"><strong>주요 설정 설명:</strong></p>
                        <ul class="text-sm text-orange-700 space-y-1">
                            <li>• <code class="bg-orange-100 px-1 rounded">version: '3.8'</code>: Docker Compose 파일 버전</li>
                            <li>• <code class="bg-orange-100 px-1 rounded">build</code>: Dockerfile로 이미지 빌드</li>
                            <li>• <code class="bg-orange-100 px-1 rounded">ports</code>: 포트 매핑</li>
                            <li>• <code class="bg-orange-100 px-1 rounded">restart</code>: 자동 재시작 정책</li>
                            <li>• <code class="bg-orange-100 px-1 rounded">networks</code>: 컨테이너 간 통신 네트워크</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3-2: 확장된 docker-compose.yml (참고) -->
            <div class="mb-8">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4 flex items-center">
                    <span class="step-number" style="background: #f97316;">2</span>
                    확장된 docker-compose.yml (참고용)
                </h3>

                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-3">🚀 실제 프로젝트에서 사용 가능한 구성</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">RDS 대신 MariaDB 컨테이너를 사용하는 경우</p>

                    <pre class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-lg overflow-x-auto"><code class="language-yaml">version: '3.8'

services:
  # MariaDB 서비스
  db:
    image: mariadb:10.11
    container_name: goormjpa-db
    environment:
      MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD: root_password
      MYSQL_DATABASE: goormjpa
      MYSQL_USER: admin
      MYSQL_PASSWORD: goorm_rdb_password
    ports:
      - "3306:3306"
    volumes:
      - db-data:/var/lib/mysql
    restart: unless-stopped
    networks:
      - goormjpa-network
    healthcheck:
      test: ["CMD", "mysqladmin", "ping", "-h", "localhost"]
      interval: 10s
      timeout: 5s
      retries: 5

  # Spring Boot 애플리케이션
  app:
    build:
      context: .
      dockerfile: Dockerfile
    image: goormjpa-app:latest
    container_name: goormjpa-app
    ports:
      - "8080:8080"
    environment:
      - SPRING_DATASOURCE_URL=jdbc:mariadb://db:3306/goormjpa
      - SPRING_DATASOURCE_USERNAME=admin
      - SPRING_DATASOURCE_PASSWORD=goorm_rdb_password
    depends_on:
      db:
        condition: service_healthy
    restart: unless-stopped
    networks:
      - goormjpa-network

networks:
  goormjpa-network:
    driver: bridge

volumes:
  db-data:</code></pre>

                    <div class="mt-4 bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-4 rounded-r">
                        <p class="text-sm text-blue-800">
                            💡 <code class="bg-blue-100 px-1 rounded">depends_on</code>으로 DB가 준비된 후 앱이 시작되도록 설정
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3-3: EC2로 파일 전송 -->
            <div class="mb-8">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4 flex items-center">
                    <span class="step-number" style="background: #f97316;">3</span>
                    EC2로 프로젝트 파일 전송
                </h3>

                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-3">📤 필요한 파일 전송</h4>

                    <pre class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-lg overflow-x-auto"><code class="language-bash"># 프로젝트 전체를 압축
tar -czf goormjpa.tar.gz \
  --exclude='.git' \
  --exclude='.gradle' \
  --exclude='build' \
  --exclude='.idea' \
  .

# EC2로 전송 (Windows PowerShell)
scp -i goormjpa.pem goormjpa.tar.gz ubuntu@3.34.123.45:/home/ubuntu/

# EC2로 전송 (macOS/Linux)
scp -i ~/Downloads/goormjpa.pem goormjpa.tar.gz ubuntu@3.34.123.45:/home/ubuntu/</code></pre>

                    <div class="mt-4 bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-500 p-4 rounded-r">
                        <p class="text-sm text-yellow-800">
                            💡 <strong>Git 사용 시:</strong> EC2에서 직접 <code class="bg-yellow-100 px-1 rounded">git clone</code>하면 더 편리합니다
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3-4: EC2에 Docker Compose 설치 -->
            <div class="mb-8">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4 flex items-center">
                    <span class="step-number" style="background: #f97316;">4</span>
                    EC2에 Docker Compose 설치
                </h3>

                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-3">🔧 Docker Compose V2 설치</h4>

                    <pre class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-lg overflow-x-auto"><code class="language-bash"># SSH 접속
ssh -i goormjpa.pem ubuntu@3.34.123.45

# Docker Compose 설치
sudo apt update
sudo apt install docker-compose-plugin -y

# 설치 확인
docker compose version
# Docker Compose version v2.21.0</code></pre>

                    <div class="mt-4 bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-4 rounded-r">
                        <p class="text-sm text-blue-800">
                            💡 최신 Docker에는 <code class="bg-blue-100 px-1 rounded">docker compose</code> (띄어쓰기) 명령어 사용
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3-5: Docker Compose 실행 -->
            <div class="mb-8">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4 flex items-center">
                    <span class="step-number" style="background: #f97316;">5</span>
                    Docker Compose 실행
                </h3>

                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-3">🚀 컨테이너 빌드 및 실행</h4>

                    <pre class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-lg overflow-x-auto"><code class="language-bash"># 압축 해제
tar -xzf goormjpa.tar.gz
cd goormjpa

# Docker Compose로 빌드 및 실행
docker compose up -d --build

# 실행 확인
docker compose ps

# 로그 확인
docker compose logs

# 실시간 로그 확인
docker compose logs -f app</code></pre>

                    <div class="mt-4 bg-orange-50 border-l-4 border-orange-500 p-4 rounded-r">
                        <p class="text-sm text-orange-800 mb-2"><strong>주요 옵션 설명:</strong></p>
                        <ul class="text-sm text-orange-700 space-y-1">
                            <li>• <code class="bg-orange-100 px-1 rounded">-d</code>: 백그라운드 실행 (detached mode)</li>
                            <li>• <code class="bg-orange-100 px-1 rounded">--build</code>: 이미지 다시 빌드</li>
                            <li>• <code class="bg-orange-100 px-1 rounded">-f app</code>: 특정 서비스 로그만 보기</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-2">📸 이미지: Docker Compose 실행 화면 (compose-up.png)</p>
                        <div class="bg-slate-100 border-2 border-dashed border-slate-300 rounded-lg h-48 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <span class="text-slate-400">이미지 영역</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3-6: Docker Compose 관리 -->
            <div class="mb-8">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4 flex items-center">
                    <span class="step-number" style="background: #f97316;">6</span>
                    Docker Compose 관리
                </h3>

                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-3">🔧 유용한 Docker Compose 명령어</h4>

                    <pre class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-lg overflow-x-auto"><code class="language-bash"># 모든 컨테이너 중지
docker compose stop

# 모든 컨테이너 시작
docker compose start

# 모든 컨테이너 재시작
docker compose restart

# 컨테이너 중지 및 삭제
docker compose down

# 컨테이너 + 볼륨 삭제
docker compose down -v

# 특정 서비스만 재시작
docker compose restart app

# 실행 중인 서비스 목록
docker compose ps

# 리소스 사용량 확인
docker compose stats

# 특정 컨테이너 내부 접속
docker compose exec app /bin/bash

# 설정 파일 검증
docker compose config</code></pre>
                </div>
            </div>

