                    접속 테스트
                </h3>

                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-3">🌐 브라우저 접속</h4>

                    <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-lg p-4 mb-4">
                        <code class="text-orange-600 font-mono">http://3.34.123.45:8080</code>
